  "description": "Bellatrix is a star-shaped geometric climbing frame in our Khel-Khud collection. Its grey and yellow frame has climbing discs, a disc ladder and a climbing net, with a Cherry Red slide on one side. Children can approach from any direction, so no two climbs are the same. Activities include climbing, hanging, balancing, rolling and sliding, and the open frame asks children to plan a route, which builds problem solving and strategy. It suits ages 5 to 12, holds up to 15 children, and needs a safe play area of 21'9\" x 19'3\". We cover the galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope for 3 years. Send us your site size and we will check the fit.",
